AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000092> "disposition of"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000092> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052>)

