AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002131> "x overlaps y if and only if there exists some z such that x has part z and z part of y")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002131> "overlaps"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002131> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002323>)
