# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002162> (in taxon)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002162> "x is in taxon y if an only if y is an organism, and the relationship between x and y is one of: part of (reflexive), developmentally preceded by, derives from, secreted by, expressed.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002162> "life cycle stage of"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002162> "Connects a biological entity to its taxon of origin.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002162> "in taxon")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002162> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002320>)
ObjectPropertyRange(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002162> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/COB_0000022>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002314> (characteristic of part of)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002314> "q characteristic of part of w if and only if there exists some p such that q inheres in p and p part of w.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002314> "characteristic of part of"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002314> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002502>)

