AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000038> "A diagram that presents one or more tuples of information by mapping those tuples in to a two dimensional space in a non arbitrary way."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000038> "graph"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000038> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000309>)

