AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000202> "Philly2013: Historically, this role would have been borne only by humans or organizations. However, we now also want to enable investigations run by robot scientists such as ADAM (King et al, Science, 2009)")
