# Class: <http://www.bioassayontology.org/bao#BAO_0000362> (mammalian)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.bioassayontology.org/bao#BAO_0000362> "This includes animal models typically used in drug discovery for toxicity or pharmacology studies, such as mouse, rat (mammals).")
